ooks a bit like this if you observe  carefully  you will see that just one angle is  obtuse a triangle in which one angle is  obtuse is called an obtuse angle this  angle in the triangle is greater than 90  degrees which makes it obtuse so this  was the basic classification of  triangles to revisit what we have  covered so far please go through the  summary at the end of this video
 

